## Project Setup

This is a Next.js 15 project with TinaCMS integration.

### Node Version
This project requires Node.js >=22.0.0 (specified in package.json).
Always run `nvm use` before any pnpm commands!

### Package Manager
USE ONLY PNPM! Never use npm or yarn!

### Development Commands

1. **Development Server:**
   ```bash
   nvm use
   pnpm run dev
   ```
   This runs TinaCMS dev server with Next.js in turbopack mode.

2. **Build:**
   ```bash
   nvm use
   pnpm run build
   ```
   This runs `tinacms build` followed by `next build`.

3. **Start Production:**
   ```bash
   nvm use
   pnpm start
   ```
